"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"Mukama yalayira,","poem":1},{"text":"era tagenda kukijjulula,","poem":2},{"text":"yagamba nti, “Olibeera kabona emirembe gyonna","poem":1},{"text":"ng’engeri ya Merukizeddeeki bw’eri.”","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Mukama anaakulwaniriranga;","poem":1},{"text":"bakabaka abakulwanyisa anaababetentanga mu busungu bwe obungi.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Aliramula amawanga, abafuzi b’ensi yonna n’abazikiriza,","poem":1},{"text":"n’entuumo z’emirambo ziriba nnyingi ku nsi yonna.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Alinywa amazzi mu kagga ku kkubo,","poem":1},{"text":"n’addamu amaanyi ag’obuwanguzi.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":23,"caller":"+","text":"Entebe ez’obwakabaka ez’edda, zaateekebwanga waggulu, kabaka ng’alina kulinnya maddaala okutuulako. Bakabaka abaawangulanga abalabe baabwe, babafufugazanga ne babassa wansi w’ebigere byabwe.","reference":{"chapter":110,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/lug_bib/PSA/110.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/lug_bib/PSA/111.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/lug_bib/PSA/109.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}